WEBVTT

00:00:00.634 --> 00:00:03.938
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> When I woke up the garden was all white.

00:00:04.317 --> 00:00:06.367
It <b>had snowed</b> during the night.

00:00:08.292 --> 00:00:12.315
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I suddenly realized that I<b>’d left</b> my phone in the taxi.

00:00:14.275 --> 00:00:18.410
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> We got home just in time – the match <b>hadn’t started</b>.

00:00:20.339 --> 00:00:24.807
<v><b>Speaker 4:</b></v> When she got to class, she realized that she <b>hadn’t brought</b> her book.

00:00:26.814 --> 00:00:29.254
<v><b>A:</b></v> I went to Paris last weekend.

00:00:29.278 --> 00:00:31.278
I really loved it.

00:00:32.915 --> 00:00:34.674
<v><b>B:</b></v><b> Had</b> you <b>been</b> there before?

00:00:35.237 --> 00:00:36.714
<v><b>A:</b></v> No, I <b>hadn’t</b>.